  "display_title": "Flirting with The Villain's Dad",
  "description": "Ack! I'm trapped in this webnovel, \"Brigitte Wants to be Happy!\" No prob, I KNOW what's gonna happen so I'll just—wait. I'm not Brigitte? I'm her aunt, Princess Yerenika?! Uh-oh. I'm stuck 20 years before the main plot... and everyone in my generation ends up tragically dead! Her parents, dead. Me, dead. Villain's dad, King Euredian, dead. A-ha! That's the key. I just need to prevent the villain from being born... time to break out some seduction schemes and flirt like my life depends on it! \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Chapter count include 19 side stories.*",
